OL,3,GNEWSAPlans to turn closed rural GP
OL,4,Asurgery into a house
OL,5,
OL,6,FA recently closed rural GP surgery
OL,7,Fcould be turned into a house after it
OL,8,Fwas deemed "not viable" for use by the
OL,9,FNHS.
OL,11,FDuddon Valley Medical Practice's
OL,12,Fsurgery in Kirkby-in-Furness, near
OL,13,FUlverston, closed at the end of July,
OL,14,Fwith patients being taken on by the
OL,15,Fgroup's Broughton and Askam surgeries.
OL,17,FDr Helen Clayson, who practised at the
OL,18,Fsurgery for 22 years until 2007, has
OL,19,Fapplied to Westmorland and Furness
OL,20,FCouncil to turn the building into a
OL,21,Fthree-bedroom house.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
