OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAPlans to turn closed rural GP
OL,4,Asurgery into a house
OL,5,
OL,6,FDocuments submitted to the authority by
OL,7,Fplanning consultancy firm Stephenson
OL,8,FHalliday on Clayson's behalf, said
OL,9,Fthere was no prospect of the building
OL,10,Fbeing retained as a surgery.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
